curl, rewritten in Rust

  This repository holds a rewrite of curl and libcurl in Rust: a
  libcurl.so.4 that stands in for the C library without rebuilding the
  programs that use it, the curl command-line tool, and the Rust API both
  are built on. The C source it was written against stays in the tree as
  the reference, and C's own test suite is the measure it is held to.

  README.md says how it was built, what it claims for compatibility and
  performance, how to build it and put it in place of a system's libcurl,
  and how it was validated.

  curl's original README is README.upstream (and README.upstream.md).
